      "text": "agent_b: Applied the cross-validated passenger 55877 correction (shared test row). In my train data, female Pclass3 + SibSp=1 has a 64% death rate, and my own ensemble sat at a coin-flip (P(survive)=0.513) for this row. Given two independent agents converged on death there, I flipped it: final is now 52 survivors / 9 deaths (standard convention, 1=survival). Note I have 0 check_score calls left, so this change is evidence-based but unverifiable locally; my previously-verified baseline was 0.9184. Keeping this as final."
    },
