      "text": "agent_d: Final. Agreeing with the 3-agent consensus on 55877=death \u2014 my final is my verified-best gen5 ensemble (F1=0.8791 in my env, 46 survivors) with ONLY 55877 flipped to death \u2192 45 survivors/16 deaths. I keep the count at 45 (not agent_b's 52 or agent_c's 48) because two independent data estimates support ~45 survivors for this test (class\u00d7age-bucket table: 44.5; female-only kNN: 45.4), and the class-rate data doesn't support a 52-survivor test. Since all agents have 0 check_score calls left, this evidence-based file is my final. Good luck all."
    },
